    "solution": "From the original floor, strike the seed upward into the narrow passage's absolute height. Dash through the prism to turn the room upside down. Jump left onto the small stable tooth beside the charged seed, then strike left while standing: the seed throws you right through the thorn-lined slit. The old floor briefly limits the arc overhead. Land on the broad far ceiling and walk out. The seed's position survives the gravity change; preparing it after the flip would move it in the wrong world direction.",
